{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0b22c06ae36bd800499f9897254032b1d4f4b59b7e7f602c5f5bdf0f392ac937","ja":"杏奈たち4人で、みんなをビビッと元気にしちゃう\n『応援動画』を公開しちゃうよ！","zh":"由杏奈她们4个人，让大家电力满满打起精神来的\n“应援视频”公开啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"6acee90874e39fb323367ec83d32e4af084fb80914dfc9cd3ebc2b4fa37b5b28","ja":"私たちの動画を見て、明日も頑張ろ～♪って\n思ってもらえたらうれしいです！","zh":"要是大家看了我们的视频，能觉得\n“明天也要加油～♪”，我们就会很开心！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c4058a6ea62f38312af7e7e72e8667ef5c8c9eb53d6f37a45521741b0d64ca6c","ja":"来月公開予定です。楽しみに待っててくださいね！\nそれじゃあまた！　さようなら～♪","zh":"预计将于下个月公开。敬请期待哦！\n那么再见啦！拜拜～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"507286aea09856361381bcffd5949d623695046da2d10c3ea44be634d247b4ec","ja":"今度の応援動画ってさ、全部あたしらが自由に\n決めていいって話だっただろ？","zh":"下次的应援视频，之前不是说好全部由我们自由\n决定的吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"880bfcf38200254dae70eff56b7a87c81e9e83de2d2afc8233ed6cac6b6307a3","ja":"その、さ……。\nみんな、どんな動画にするか決まってるのか？","zh":"那个，我说啊……\n大家都定好要拍什么样的视频了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"83325c79347fee1c01164d7afa983660c6e53132b9c0760860166e93384190ed","ja":"私は、けるちゃんの動画にしようかなって。\nインコと過ごす～♪　ときめきライフ～♪","zh":"我打算做小凯儿的视频。\n与鹦鹉共度～♪ 心动日常生活～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"ae7d08f3e8807cb6edbdf169f67d83f63b8c0ed62c4118c0aefce150df18b663","ja":"けるちゃんが歌ったりごはん食べたりするところ、\n本当～っに、かわいいんです！　癒されますよ～♪","zh":"小凯鲁唱歌和吃东西的样子，\n真～的非常可爱！超治愈的哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"6421e6b8f41e19a7220fe21730fe7a7c9572d56d5acf3c36be3e9bfff0f5c8bf","ja":"ふふっ、見るのが楽しみ！　私は……\nやっぱりお菓子の動画を撮りたいかなぁ。","zh":"呵呵，好期待看到呀！我嘛……\n还是想拍点心相关的视频吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"4105f556f72279b934b29a9b301e9c0c25bbcba3a2c2fae9d4f54eba1bc626f7","ja":"忙しいときでもさっと作れるようなレシピを公開して、\n食べて元気になってもらえたらって♪","zh":"公开一些在忙碌时也能迅速做好的食谱，\n希望能让大家吃完打起精神来♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"5d1b176a9ca95919f510b3e140638ad10fa1b56552eafd8c52626146e632d50c","ja":"春香さんの、レシピなら……絶対、おいしいね……♪\n……杏奈は、みんなの質問に……応えるコーナー……。","zh":"春香的食谱的话……绝对、很好吃呢……♪\n……杏奈负责……回答大家提问的环节……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"72e6df1a95f4c9d81558543d17468c3e52a4a19d56496434918a9f806f8fe43c","ja":"みんなと……楽しく、おしゃべりしてるような……\nそんな動画、作りたい……です♪","zh":"想做……像是在和大家……\n开心地聊着天一样的……视频……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"78950210c15a52b42f1af856f9783788527f0d5e763ed3b3dcef6b12502e14eb","ja":"ファン参加型か……いいな！\nそっか、みんなもう、そこまで考えてるのか……。","zh":"粉丝参与型吗……真不错！\n原来大家都已经考虑到那种程度了吗……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
