{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1041.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"2eb9f5d54579e2b7210f97b139eba003e4d9d5d411375229dc9becf6ee0e4459","ja":"うん。最初は、やっぱ歌かなって\n思ったんだけどさ……。","zh":"嗯。我一开始虽然也是觉得\n果然还是唱歌吧，不过……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
